# THE VAULT tracks everything by default. Two narrow classes escape:
#
#   SECRETS — credential material. NON-.md ONLY: Markdown is force-tracked at
#             the bottom, so a secret pasted into prose is the scanner's job
#             (.github/scripts/check_secret_patterns.py), never this file's.
#             Name secrets exactly or by safe extension — NOT unanchored
#             substring globs (`*_keys*` eats "monkeys", `id_*` eats "identity").
#
#   EXHAUST — machine-generated files that never held human authorship AND
#             regenerate if deleted: OS droppings, build output, caches, runtime
#             state. NOTE: a bare `dir/` ignore is a Markdown blind spot —
#             `!/**.md` CANNOT rescue prose under an excluded directory (git:
#             "no matter where they are defined"). For a dir that may hold prose,
#             ignore its contents not the dir: `dir/**` + `!dir/**/` + `!dir/**/*.md`

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# EXHAUST — OS system files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
._*
Icon?
~*
.fuse_hidden*
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
.stackdump
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.AppleDB
.AppleDesktop
.LSOverride
.DocumentRevisions-V100
.fseventsd
.Spotlight-V100
.TemporaryItems
.Trashes
.VolumeIcon.icns
.com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent
.apdisk
*.icloud
Network Trash Folder
Temporary Items

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# EXHAUST — packages, builds, environments (never-content names only)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
/build/
/dist/
/node_modules/
/vendor/
/env/
/venv/
.venv
/cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# EXHAUST — large model/media stores + agent runtime state (exact paths)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
.ollama/models/blobs
/.cache/codex-runtimes/codex-primary-runtime
/.claude/plugins/marketplaces
/.claude/file-history
/.codex/.tmp/bundled-marketplaces
/.codex/plugins/.remote-plugin-install-staging
/.codex/plugins/cache
/.codex/skills/.system
.aikido/config

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS — non-.md credential material, named not guessed
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
.cache_ggshield
.env
.env.*
*.pem
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.pub
known_hosts
.claude/.credentials.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS — Obsidian plugin data.json (ENUMERATED, never globbed:
# a *-wildcard here sweeps load-bearing plugin config and broke the install)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
.obsidian/plugins/ai-templater/data.json
.obsidian/plugins/ai-image-analyzer/data.json
.obsidian/plugins/obsidian-local-rest-api/data.json
.obsidian/plugins/phone-to-roam-to-obsidian/data.json
.obsidian/plugins/todoist-context-bridge/data.json
.obsidian/plugins/mcp-tools/bin/mcp-server.exe

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# KEEP — re-include tracked-by-default surfaces (MUST be last)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
!.gitignore
!/.*/stub.txt
!/**.md

# THE WORLD IS QUIET HERE．ESTO PERPETUA!
